# The race's help (spec M4c): pause.scenario's way into the race, F1 after the start (the
# race fades out, the keys' page, Return, the tips' page, Return, the race fades back in),
# then Escape, F1 in the pause box, and the help again. A shot every 100 ms; the keys held
# 100 ms; run with --no-ai.
